      "text": "The listed non-NULL premises are insufficient: with `customers.id TEXT NOT NULL COLLATE BINARY` containing `'a'` and `blocked.customer_id TEXT NOT NULL COLLATE NOCASE` containing `'A'`, `NOT IN` returns `'a'` while `NOT EXISTS` returns nothing because [collation depends on operand order](https://www.sqlite.org/datatype3.html#assigning_collating_sequences_from_sql). Fix: also require compatible comparison collations or sufficient integer-schema premises, and retain this counterexample."
